iona:</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="122" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">Nosso sistema analisa dados da plantação e calculanautomaticamente a quantidade ideal de agua necessaria para cada cultivo</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="22" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">💧Control Inteligente&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="41" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">Monitoramento da irrigação em tempo real.</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="18" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">🌿Sustentabilidade</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="47" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">Redução do desperdicio e preservação ambiental.</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="19" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">📊Analise de Dados&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="50" class="C9DxTc " style="font-family: Georgia, Arial; font-size: 16.0px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: baseline;">Informações precisas sobre solo, clima e produção.</span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" class="zfr3Q CDt4Ke " style=""><span data-ri="0" data-sc="22" class="C